==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Boundaries Crossed|Darmanitan|28}} from the {{TCG|Boundaries Crossed}} expansion.
*'''Darmani-Hands''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Dragon Majesty|Darmanitan|9}} from the {{TCG|Dragon Majesty}} expansion.
